1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
In this video, we will learn how to use the AI sticker generator.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Entering the keyword will allow you to create a sticker based on your choice, and you can actually check the effect in the 3D window.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Before running the AI sticker generator, please add a sticker to the costume first.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:26,000
By adjusting the sticker tool, select the sticker that needs to be replaced with the picture.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:34,000
In the sticker attribute, click the AI sticker generator button on the default side.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,000
The AI sticker generator window will pop up.

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:49,000
In the options at the top of the dialogue window, you can set the type of the picture and whether to open the transparent background, then enter the keyword.

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Below the keyword is the final picture generated.

9
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,000
In the history record window,

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,000
you can see the history record of the picture,

11
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
and the previous picture generated.

12
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
At the top of each picture in the history record,

13
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,000
you can see the selected options and keywords for generating this picture.

14
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:09,000
The history record will remain before you close Marvelous Designer.

15
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Next, let's take a look at the various options of the AI sticker generator.

16
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:17,000
You can select the style category of the pattern in the pattern category.

17
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Under the art style, you can select the specific sticker art style.

18
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:25,000
If you do not need to specify any special art style,

19
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,000
you can select no.

20
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:32,000
If you choose a transparent background,

21
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:37,000
the background of the sticker generated is transparent.

22
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Please note that you cannot generate a transparent background art sticker.

23
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Now let's enter the keyword and start generating the sticker.

24
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:50,000
When you enter the keyword,

25
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:54,000
using the English keyword will help you generate more accurate pictures.

26
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,000
When you enter the keyword,

27
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:02,000
click the generate button to generate a picture.

28
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:06,000
The generated pictures are continuous in all directions.

29
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:09,000
The AI sticker generator generates pictures randomly every time.

30
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Therefore, even if the keywords are the same,

31
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:19,000
the results of the generation are also diverse.

32
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:21,000
When entering keywords,

33
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,000
we recommend that you use words,

34
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,000
not long sentences,

35
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:29,000
and long sentences to describe them.

36
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Long sentences may lead to incorrect results.

37
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:38,000
It is recommended that you use words and keywords to define keywords.

38
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:40,000
If you want to emphasize a keyword,

39
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:45,000
please emphasize it with a keyword.

40
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:50,000
The keywords in the keyword will give more weight.

41
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,000
When you use a keyword once,

42
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:53,000
its weight will be 1.1 times.

43
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,000
When you use a keyword twice,

44
00:02:54,000 --> 00:03:02,000
its weight will be 1.2 times.

45
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:15,000
You can see that different keywords will have different results.

46
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:17,000
When you want to generate a picture randomly,

47
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:19,000
click the random icon in the investment form,

48
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:26,000
and the random icon will set and set keywords randomly.

49
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,000
By setting randomly,

50
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:29,000
you can create various types of pictures,

51
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:40,000
enriching your creation.

52
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:43,000
When you want to generate a new picture similar to the previous result,

53
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:45,000
or want to update some keywords,

54
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,000
please click the Keep Keywords button.

55
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,000
When you click Create,

56
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:57,000
you can see that the generated picture is similar to the previous one.

57
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,759
Please note that if you modify keywords,

58
00:03:59,759 --> 00:04:04,000
the results may be due to the addition or modification of keywords

59
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:09,000
that are different from the previous generated pictures.

60
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:12,000
You may need to generate a picture for a certain time,

61
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:17,000
so you can click the arrow button in the upper right corner to fold the window.

62
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:28,000
When waiting for the picture to be created, you can continue to adjust the costume or other changes.

63
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:33,000
When the picture is created, the foldable window will remind you that the picture has been created.

64
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:44,000
If you need to open the window, click the arrow in the upper right corner again.

65
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:48,000
When the picture is created, click the application button at the bottom.

66
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:55,000
You can also go to the history record and use the previous picture as a sticker.

67
00:04:55,000 --> 00:05:00,000
You can add more interesting content to your design through this function.

68
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:04,000
Thank you for watching, see you in the next video.

